{
  "name": "AI Ops Assistant — notify + retry",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ops-assistant",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-ops",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 300],
      "webhookId": "ops-assistant"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json;\nconst event = body.event || 'unknown';\nconst status = body.status || 'unknown';\nconst ticketId = body.ticket_id;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ticket_id: ticketId,\n    event,\n    status,\n    audit: {\n      received_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n      source: 'ai-ops-assistant',\n      payload: body\n    },\n    should_retry: event === 'agent_error' || event === 'validation_failed' || status === 'failed'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "audit-transform",
      "name": "Audit Transform",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.should_retry}}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-retry",
      "name": "Should Retry?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://backend:8000/tickets/{{$json.ticket_id}}/retry",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-retry",
      "name": "Retry Ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [920, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://backend:8000/webhooks/n8n",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Webhook-Secret",
              "value": "change-me-n8n-secret"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"ticket_id\": \"{{$json.ticket_id}}\",\n  \"action\": \"ack\",\n  \"detail\": \"n8n audited event {{$json.event}}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-ack",
      "name": "Ack Callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [920, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Ops Assistant workflow\n\n1. Receives agent handoff webhook\n2. Builds an audit payload\n3. Retries failed tickets via `POST /tickets/{id}/retry`\n4. ACKs successful reviews via `/webhooks/n8n`\n\n**Import:** In n8n UI → Workflows → Import from File → this JSON.\nActivate the workflow so the webhook path `/webhook/ops-assistant` is live.\n\nReplace the webhook secret header to match `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [40, 80]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Audit Transform",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Audit Transform": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Should Retry?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Should Retry?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Retry Ticket",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Ack Callback",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "versionId": "1",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "ai-ops-assistant"
    }
  ]
}
